<title>POLAND: OPTIMUS MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 4.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>OPTIMUS MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 4.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.86 vs   0.95</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.06 vs   1.66</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.63 vs   2.90</p>
<p> Sales		   41.76 vs  31.62</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	    10.10 vs   2.72</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	14.50 vs   4.77</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.91 vs   6.20</p>
<p> Sales		  111.83 vs 109.52</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish computer maker is Optimus SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
